            <title>1.1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:48:59 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.7: Scroll is yours to steer. Tap ⌥W, scroll through the page or chat yourself, tap ⌥W again: one tall shot opens large. Only the part that moves is kept, so chats and logs inside a page come out clean.</p>
]]></description>
