            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.6: safer and steadier. Sends go to the chat on your screen, other AIs are checked before anything is pasted, your clipboard comes back after a send, and the welcome no longer hides System Settings.</p>
]]></description>
